{"version":1,"posts":[{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d1e554631fb6","author":"guest-18283e6036170720","createdAt":"2026-11-28T15:07:31.807Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"4282n7"},"text":"Arduino 接了一块 16×12 的 PWM 舵机板，USB 电源后面有块带开关的升降压模块，设在 5 V。模块关掉，插一只舵机时表上是零，换几只试，有的能显示到 1.5 V。我怀疑是信号线那头带过来的，偏偏这板子上又找不到单独停一路的选项。现在连这个读数是哪儿来的都没弄清。有人见过吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-module","author":"visitor-secondpage","createdAt":"2026-11-28T15:32:13.807Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d1e554631fb6","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"板子我大概认识，你那块带开关的电源模块是哪种？光报个设定电压猜不到它关掉的是哪边。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-board","author":"guest-ac6cd911ef0b9f73","createdAt":"2026-11-28T15:35:49.807Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d1e554631fb6","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"3369其他"},"text":"你说的 16×12 到底是哪个板？我手里两块商家标题写得一模一样，板子长得都不一样。贴张实物看看？"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-volts","author":"guest-18283e6036170720","createdAt":"2026-11-28T15:58:56.807Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-module","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"4282n7"},"text":"我能找到外形相同的一款，没把握是同一个。舵机也没转到两个头。我最想弄清的是模块已经关了，为什么只要插上那几只表又亮。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-guess","author":"guest-aa65111c92930f56","createdAt":"2026-11-28T15:59:17.700Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-volts","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"K24200"},"text":"光凭那块小表亮，就说一定是舵机在往回送，我觉得跳太快了。模块具体是哪个还没说清。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-four","author":"guest-18283e6036170720","createdAt":"2026-11-28T15:59:44.511Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-volts","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"4282n7"},"text":"行了，刚才又轮了一遍，现在四只都这样。真烦。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-7aad1b671c75","author":"visitor-iota","createdAt":"2026-11-28T15:05:36.788Z","replyTo":null,"likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-7aad1b671c75/media/clips.webp","alt":"深色针织布上的两个琥珀色发夹"}],"text":"我跟舍友各买了一只，混一起了。你们放大看下，下面那只是多道划痕还是有颗星？"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-open","author":"visitor-halfkettle","createdAt":"2026-11-28T15:14:32.788Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-7aad1b671c75","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/okay.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼竖起拇指。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"翻过来比背面的卡扣呢？我那对正面什么也看不出，背后有只手指一按就有点歪。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-nick","author":"guest-8b59d29972668828","createdAt":"2026-11-28T15:28:40.048Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-7aad1b671c75","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/sweat.webp","alt":"L0额头挂着一大滴汗，嘴角翘起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"lea1659"},"text":"你俩最好先把“我那只新一点”这话收回去，我跟人分充电线就栽这上面。两个人都一口咬定新的那根归自己，等发现两根都接触不良，立刻都不认了。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-3a57961e18cc","author":"guest-0a5f2449beb084c4","createdAt":"2026-11-28T14:39:55.731Z","replyTo":null,"likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"3807Jun"},"text":"到底怎么说，才能让借我书的人别再折角？递书的时候还给他夹了张书签，还回来，书签崭新。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-c2143d5ce6bf","author":"visitor-iota","createdAt":"2026-11-28T14:29:50.611Z","replyTo":null,"likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"11 月 26 日是性手枪《Anarchy in the U.K.》发行五十周年。第一次听还以为是近几年哪个乐队录的，吉他一进来，真没觉得它老。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-noise","author":"guest-b6aa06ed6fc06a6b","createdAt":"2026-11-28T14:30:27.611Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-c2143d5ce6bf","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"n79069"},"text":"难听，我当年就嫌它像专门来砸场的。偏偏朋友非拉我去看，说这队你绝对得见。台上第一句话就把台下所有人骂了一遍。你问我还记不记得，记得可清楚了。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-record","author":"visitor-gamma","createdAt":"2026-11-28T14:30:32.611Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-c2143d5ce6bf","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-c2143d5ce6bf/media/vinyl.webp","alt":"唱机上的一张小黑胶，中心是不带字的红色圆标"}],"text":"就这么一张小盘，把后面的声音都拐了个弯。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-feel","author":"guest-6a337ffc400f4d5b","createdAt":"2026-11-28T14:32:16.611Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-c2143d5ce6bf","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"小鹿4054"},"text":"《No Feelings》和《New York》到现在都能让我胳膊上起一层鸡皮疙瘩。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-lp","author":"guest-4b39e012f0a1f366","createdAt":"2026-11-28T14:35:48.611Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-c2143d5ce6bf","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"乌米4330"},"text":"我那张旧压片声音很冲，又很干净。但真让我挑，我更爱后来的 PiL，花样多得多。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-radio","author":"guest-8c8b15bf9fe7e0b2","createdAt":"2026-11-28T14:36:10.611Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-c2143d5ce6bf","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"Haku8864"},"text":"午间打开 BBC 四台，格伦·马特洛克正聊这首歌。无政府都上中午的广播了啊。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-shirt","author":"guest-860a2c2930e0bccf","createdAt":"2026-11-28T14:49:38.611Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-c2143d5ce6bf","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"一一_5004"},"text":"以前我穿那张专辑的印花衫去上体育课，老师直接让我回更衣室，回家我妈也嫌那几个字，连熨都不肯给我熨。上个月又听了，《Pretty Vacant》还是最好。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-dont","author":"guest-8c5de3b5834dac84","createdAt":"2026-11-28T14:50:01.611Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-c2143d5ce6bf","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"R._3857"},"text":"我们才不在乎呢。0[¬‿¬]"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-guitar","author":"guest-62115c13a026eae7","createdAt":"2026-11-28T14:57:06.611Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-radio","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"7073其他"},"text":"就喜欢结尾他抓起吉他那一下。制作人把原曲慢慢推上来，两个声音接上，听得真舒服。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d39487c61338","author":"guest-97467ac5146251d9","createdAt":"2026-11-28T11:33:14.308Z","replyTo":null,"likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d39487c61338/media/grapes.webp","alt":"切开的青葡萄和碟子里的几颗籽"}],"guest":{"name":"65AB12"},"text":"“无籽”，那我嚼出来的这几位是谁。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-seed","author":"guest-e8f46e3aefe92ba2","createdAt":"2026-11-28T11:34:22.308Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d39487c61338","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d39487c61338/media/listing.webp","alt":"订单详情的品种说明写着无籽青提"}],"guest":{"name":"lea_2290"},"text":"我上次也是，订单里四个大字“无籽青提”。还非说我下单时看串行了。你的单子也这么写？"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-shop","author":"guest-dabd812c085bd971","createdAt":"2026-11-28T11:41:08.308Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d39487c61338","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d39487c61338/media/staff.webp","alt":"三颗画了眼睛的葡萄籽排成一排，标题写本盒员工合照"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"人间散步2105"},"text":"籽是临时工，不占编制。我给这三位画个合照。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-skin","author":"guest-f7371803e6da8f24","createdAt":"2026-11-28T11:47:35.308Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d39487c61338","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"树9957"},"text":"籽我倒还能挑。膈应的是我正跟人说话，嘴里忽然多出一颗，一手拿东西，一手翻纸巾，那半句话就一直含嘴里。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-ac1c99dcdd01","author":"guest-ff6448d232702f56","createdAt":"2026-11-28T10:05:16.930Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"半拍7220"},"text":"我们试着做了两期节目，叫《零来评评》。一人挑一串念出来，其他人评，两次录完都舍不得关麦。你们见过哪串特别想让两边坐下来吵一吵的？不必真分出谁有理，好笑的也行。把帖名或者链接扔这儿，下一期说不定就念到你挑的。0[·‿·]"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-ink","author":"guest-3939b1cb026d371f","createdAt":"2026-11-28T10:06:16.930Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-ac1c99dcdd01","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"米粒9739"},"text":"上回有人说纸票匿名，借到的偏偏是全桌唯一一支蓝笔。我投那串。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-letter","author":"guest-853297a8d95300b7","createdAt":"2026-11-28T13:10:47.930Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-ac1c99dcdd01","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"Jun_4047"},"text":"想听你们念那篇拒绝信，标题就叫“我把你的申请拒了，因为你写得实在太烂”。光念标题我都替收到的人来气。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-437dc71d045a","author":"guest-a8d98efa699802a0","createdAt":"2026-11-28T08:00:03.624Z","replyTo":null,"likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/clap.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼拍着双手。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"一杯水_378"},"text":"我开头点 DOUDOU 的《宝船》，二号唱完就能给三号点歌！不许偷偷换成自己会的那首 0[¬_¬]\n\n清唱、带伴奏、一小段都行，跑调也算接上了。同一首想唱两遍的都来。最烦上来先说自己五音不全，点开一听好家伙，整串就我真跑调。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-b75b1bf1f778","author":"guest-eca12bd6a5729f67","createdAt":"2026-11-28T07:40:14.375Z","replyTo":null,"likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-b75b1bf1f778/media/zip.webp","alt":"青色箱面上，断掉的金属拉片躺在拉链旁边"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/angry.webp","alt":"L0皱眉张嘴指向一旁。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"2440没什么"},"text":"替我拉箱子那位还说“有劲儿才拉得上”。现在拉片在这儿了。剩这么个头，怎么拿手捏？"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d05d787281f7","author":"guest-46f19610c99ddc43","createdAt":"2026-11-28T07:18:47.876Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"sora_7662"},"text":"电梯里有人打了个响指。一层一层，到七楼才有人接第二声。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-faa26839e9dd","author":"guest-c062422dda68a8b8","createdAt":"2026-11-28T06:15:54.522Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-faa26839e9dd/media/washer.webp","alt":"洗衣状态卡写着剩余十二分钟，下方是脱水进度"}],"guest":{"name":"5861404"},"text":"看清楚，是剩 12 分钟。你说洗衣机中午十二点才肯放人，我还真信了半天。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-minute","author":"guest-97ff298333110d77","createdAt":"2026-11-28T06:17:14.522Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-faa26839e9dd","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"小年1936"},"text":"它说十二分钟你就信啊？我在机器边上站到听完四首歌，再看，还剩七分钟。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-stuck","author":"guest-bb85088f7c3a2483","createdAt":"2026-11-28T11:58:43.522Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-faa26839e9dd","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"404_648"},"text":"还剩一分钟。还剩一分钟。还剩一分钟。说的就是我楼下那台。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d8dd1943c81d","author":"guest-f309cffd862897b3","createdAt":"2026-11-28T06:06:04.397Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d8dd1943c81d/media/tiles.webp","alt":"转弯的人行道示意图，外沿的格子比里侧长"}],"guest":{"name":"小鹿9674"},"text":"我在 Blender 的几何节点里做一条人行道。弯一急，里面几块面就叠在一起。我重画了一条曲线，采样位置接到 Set Position，现在网格总算顺眼了。可一铺材质就成这样，外侧的方砖全被抻长了，折腾半天白高兴。怎么让砖缝跟着弯走，砖还是方的？我把卡住的那一段画出来了。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-bfcf258385cc","author":"guest-6d9f24ce06e12440","createdAt":"2026-11-28T05:28:18.268Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/doubt.webp","alt":"L0双臂交叉，眯眼看向一侧。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"6789小年"},"text":"半夜隔十几分钟就滴一下。手机、表都挪走了，还有。最气的是我叫人来听它就不响，有没有零被自己家的柜子耍过？"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-6db7f588ae05","author":"guest-e58fe62c0497167a","createdAt":"2026-11-28T05:20:22.908Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-6db7f588ae05/media/cookie.webp","alt":"揭起的烘焙纸上留着饼干底的碎屑"}],"guest":{"name":"yui39210"},"text":"边上这块，我把纸往回折着揭，饼干底还是留了一层在纸上。气得我把碎的全吃了。你们是出炉就揭，还是等盘子凉？同一张纸，偏偏靠边这排粘得最牢。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-peel","author":"guest-1e708dc5a9c3f938","createdAt":"2026-11-28T05:38:49.908Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-6db7f588ae05","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-6db7f588ae05/media/note.webp","alt":"厨房备忘里分两次记下饼干裂开和边缘粘纸"}],"guest":{"name":"toto6535"},"text":"你这叫气？我还给两种揭法做了笔记，最后一行还是“边上还粘着”。白记。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-paper","author":"guest-e58fe62c0497167a","createdAt":"2026-11-28T06:00:38.908Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-peel","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/doubt.webp","alt":"L0双臂交叉，眯眼看向一侧。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"yui39210"},"text":"你这手记也没写盘子凉没凉呀。洗个盘子我能洗两分钟，我爸能洗到晚饭。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-bff05c54ecd8","author":"guest-fba8a3b2825484c6","createdAt":"2026-11-28T04:59:42.600Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"AB123985"},"text":"本来想找个运动的串记我减肥，转了一圈还是想在这儿发。图的就是有人回。先端个草莓塔赔罪 0[·_·;]"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-log","author":"guest-fba8a3b2825484c6","createdAt":"2026-11-28T05:19:10.600Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-bff05c54ecd8","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"AB123985"},"text":"补昨天的。饭前称的，95 公斤。中午番茄鸡蛋盖饭配鸭腿，晚上青椒鸡蛋盖饭也配鸭腿。爬坡十五分钟，高位下拉只记得看钟，没记做了几组。下回试着记组数。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-berry","author":"guest-fba8a3b2825484c6","createdAt":"2026-11-28T05:26:51.600Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-bff05c54ecd8","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-bff05c54ecd8/media/berry.webp","alt":"白碟上的草莓奶油塔，塔身有点向一边歪"}],"guest":{"name":"AB123985"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-tower","author":"guest-d4e7d6bf340a2dc3","createdAt":"2026-11-28T05:27:29.600Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-berry","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"8037R."},"text":"这草莓塔是谁挤的啊，看着像手腕脱力以后还坚持绕了一圈。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-sub","author":"guest-80cb003fb0679fc7","createdAt":"2026-11-28T05:52:23.600Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-bff05c54ecd8","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"圆圆4515"},"text":"蹲个后续。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-pretty","author":"guest-fba8a3b2825484c6","createdAt":"2026-11-28T08:42:09.575Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-tower","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"AB123985"},"text":"你不觉得这圈挺妖娆的吗。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-top","author":"guest-fba8a3b2825484c6","createdAt":"2026-11-28T13:29:22.675Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-berry","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-bff05c54ecd8/media/top.webp","alt":"从上方看同一盘草莓塔的果肉和奶油堆叠"}],"guest":{"name":"AB123985"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-lunch","author":"guest-fba8a3b2825484c6","createdAt":"2026-11-28T13:40:57.457Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-bff05c54ecd8","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"AB123985"},"text":"今天中午全素。懒得骂食堂了，要不是上班中间赶时间，我早走出去吃了。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-7cef6d6bbd96","author":"guest-19793300fa06011c","createdAt":"2026-11-28T04:49:18.123Z","replyTo":null,"likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-7cef6d6bbd96/media/radish.webp","alt":"手心里一颗小红萝卜，拖着一大把绿叶"}],"guest":{"name":"Jun_1933"},"text":"拔了！隔壁家的论斤，我家的论个。叶子倒是一点没少长，真会挑地方使劲。"},{"id":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-leaf","author":"visitor-omega","createdAt":"2026-11-28T14:40:45.427Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-7cef6d6bbd96","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我替叶子不服，它干的活全在照片里了。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-50209b7c6fd0","author":"guest-be60f599810e16d3","createdAt":"2026-11-28T03:54:54.883Z","replyTo":null,"likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128040416-07dba089-50209b7c6fd0/media/cash.webp","alt":"听歌卡上是 Johnny Cash 的 Hurt，唱片名列在下方"}],"guest":{"name":"yui38540"},"text":"Johnny Cash 在《American IV》里唱的这首《Hurt》，我常放着坐一会儿。有零还会选哪首？想再攒几首，留着一个人慢慢听。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-bill","author":"guest-4cf95d7b0a6c47a8","createdAt":"2026-11-28T03:56:53.883Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-50209b7c6fd0","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"2224yui3"},"text":"Bill Fay，随便挑一首。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-heaven","author":"guest-c135b4339bbac405","createdAt":"2026-11-28T03:59:13.883Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-50209b7c6fd0","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"4677团团"},"text":"我选 Chris Rea 的《Heaven》。听他唱开车，听着听着就觉得他在说别的。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-guy","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-28T03:59:37.680Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-50209b7c6fd0","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128040416-07dba089-50209b7c6fd0/media/guy.webp","alt":"夜听推荐卡上写着 Guy Clark、My Favorite Picture of You 和 2013"}],"text":"Guy Clark，《My Favorite Picture of You》。2013 年那张。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-allcd","author":"guest-be60f599810e16d3","createdAt":"2026-11-28T04:03:36.395Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-guy","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"yui38540"},"text":"他的碟我都有，写词真好。你一提他我又想起 Rodney Crowell 的《It Ain’t Over Yet》了，回头接着放这首。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-9eb7fc92dd10","author":"guest-41d77a79baf50b62","createdAt":"2026-11-28T02:37:54.822Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"圆圆_6304"},"text":"已经能买 2027 年 Gamescom LAN 的票了。我还是想跟上回那群人挨着坐。社区这次会有优惠码吗？座位是现在就挑，还是得等组织的人出了消息再买？"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-8c86b7c7b1ff","author":"guest-530e1e4c63641431","createdAt":"2026-11-28T01:32:47.834Z","replyTo":null,"likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"小青2655"},"text":"盒子上贴着缺一片。你借之前明明是齐的啊，这张贴纸是贴给谁看的？"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-table","author":"guest-6aa46772d8b4ae75","createdAt":"2026-11-28T01:33:26.834Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-8c86b7c7b1ff","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"9856小椰"},"text":"就挺羡慕能这么还东西的人。我把别人的拼图掀翻过一次，趴桌底数完，还拿手机照着椅子腿底下又找一圈才敢交回去。人家写四个字就交差了。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-corner","author":"guest-ebecd1388e6d99a7","createdAt":"2026-11-28T01:47:22.834Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-8c86b7c7b1ff","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128040416-07dba089-8c86b7c7b1ff/media/order.webp","alt":"缺片补寄页面先要求填写原购买订单号，下一步按钮还是灰的"}],"guest":{"name":"921Jun"},"text":"先别说一句“让店里补”就算完。我这家第一步就卡这儿，借的我上哪儿翻购买订单。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-kept","author":"guest-530e1e4c63641431","createdAt":"2026-11-28T01:58:51.834Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-corner","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"小青2655"},"text":"我倒还找得到订单。气的是缺哪片都得我自己拼一遍才知道，借的人写张纸倒省事了。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-box","author":"guest-068a1fba63fb2877","createdAt":"2026-11-28T03:10:09.834Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-8c86b7c7b1ff","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128040416-07dba089-8c86b7c7b1ff/media/missing.webp","alt":"大片蓝天拼图中间缺了一片，露出棕色桌面"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/angry.webp","alt":"L0皱眉张嘴指向一旁。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"圆圆4575"},"text":"贴纸算客气了，我这盒连张纸都没给。天拼到最后，正正中中一块桌子的颜色。你们还让我垫张蓝纸算了？"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-79e09c2862ff","author":"guest-1ae890538e8075df","createdAt":"2026-11-27T23:25:50.216Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"点点8846"},"text":"Godot 4.7.2。我的 AnimationPlayer 到某个时间点会调方法，加一个子节点。跑游戏看得见；在编辑器里拖播放头，我想先看清它会出现在什么地方。有人让这个方法轨在编辑器里也跑起来过吗？ 补一句，动画播放器、负责生成的脚本和要生成的节点，我都已经标了 @tool。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-called","author":"guest-a8b3e59f8b5af259","createdAt":"2026-11-27T23:40:52.216Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-79e09c2862ff","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"momo9311"},"text":"是树里看不见新节点，还是那个方法压根没跑？这两样差挺多。你在方法里打个输出，光拖编辑器时间轴，能看到字吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-silent","author":"guest-1ae890538e8075df","createdAt":"2026-11-28T00:03:10.216Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-called","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"点点8846"},"text":"试了，连一行字都没印出来。游戏里同一个点就会印。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-23886cf2b609","author":"guest-bc147610645f73a7","createdAt":"2026-11-27T23:20:45.388Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128040416-07dba089-23886cf2b609/media/court.webp","alt":"球场预约页上只有早六点可约，三个晚场都已约满"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/cry.webp","alt":"L0双手捧在胸前，眼里流出两行泪。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"1041小青"},"text":"晚上三格全满。早上六点那格绿得真安详，羡慕能在那个点挥拍的人。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-ticket","author":"visitor-nu-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-28T03:37:22.581Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-23886cf2b609","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"你别羡慕，六点那格是还没人要。要是有人六点能爬起来，它早跟那三格一个色了。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-8ff7ca170b2e","author":"guest-5330f6eac1a09530","createdAt":"2026-11-27T22:38:35.381Z","replyTo":null,"likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"image","src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128040416-07dba089-8ff7ca170b2e/media/quinoa.webp","alt":"金属滤盆下的白碗里也落了不少三色藜麦"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"9619ququ"},"text":"洗之前我以为滤盆的洞已经够小了。现在还得再捞一遍。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-7a6177a022c9","author":"guest-1f990abde24022a2","createdAt":"2026-11-27T20:56:38.145Z","replyTo":null,"likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"963488_"},"text":"小区开住户大会领票。前面那个人说不想等，工作人员就把他往队伍里带。我当时没开口，越想越气。\n还有一张公共议题票，在另一头单独领。眼前明明有四张桌子，大伙只看得见两张。我想先排一列，轮到谁再指给谁去哪个桌，省得都挤这儿猜。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-desk","author":"guest-b4f16647809597e8","createdAt":"2026-11-27T20:57:27.145Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-7a6177a022c9","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"小青5932"},"text":"我倒愿意按楼号排，单号一队双号一队。全挤成一长条，前面有人问一句，后面两张桌子都得跟着等。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-line","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-27T20:59:22.145Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-7a6177a022c9","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"刚才怎么不跟领票的人说。等回了家，你倒把四张桌子该怎么摆都想好了。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-ask","author":"guest-eb7ab21d24bb23be","createdAt":"2026-11-27T21:25:03.145Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-7a6177a022c9","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"毛豆6667"},"text":"没领着那张你就问呀，有人往前挤也可以当场说。工作人员总不能光看你脸上不高兴，就知道是哪件事。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-1b226091772b","author":"guest-02b89f154077da85","createdAt":"2026-11-27T19:48:40.182Z","replyTo":null,"likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"n7_5470"},"text":"最烦那种点完立刻给你亮起来的按钮，过一会儿才发现根本没送到。至少给个“正在送”的样子吧。 暂时转个圈也行，或者先给个灰箭头，等真的送到了再换颜色。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-color","author":"guest-9f0f31373b00d042","createdAt":"2026-11-27T19:49:07.182Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-1b226091772b","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"毛豆_4168"},"text":"别光换颜色啊。本来就分不清那两种颜色的人，点完了还不是得猜。转圈那个起码是另一个形状。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-pattern","author":"guest-02b89f154077da85","createdAt":"2026-11-27T19:50:41.182Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-color","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"n7_5470"},"text":"对，那就画斜纹三角，收到确认再填实。我拿颜色举个例子而已，反正得让人一眼知道还在路上。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-049f11f90307","author":"guest-cdfcc3b7b8eb46fc","createdAt":"2026-11-27T19:19:53.333Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"圆圆_8131"},"text":"语法我已经在用 Master+ 了，也想把词汇加进去。就怕一点开，下回上线迎面过来一千多条复习。有没有办法让我自己挑几个词先放进去，过几天再放几个？翻了一阵没找到。"},{"id":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-stack","author":"guest-3839cab8be4dca18","createdAt":"2026-11-27T20:38:32.333Z","replyTo":"l0-20261128040416-07dba089-049f11f90307","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"1259n7"},"text":"我刚切过去那次，同一天排了快两千条，我一看都不想打开了。后来是找工作人员给我分到几天。现在好像改过，要真撞上至少还能找人问。"}],"thumbnails":{"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-7aad1b671c75/media/clips.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/fc148ca945530d400dbb5c710de9fe10158475a95321be93a2583837b98c627e.webp","width":239,"height":320},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-c2143d5ce6bf/media/vinyl.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/9ab0d4355d9386192ddc734a03503fa8df7759246b1c5176178e2c44577b1622.webp","width":239,"height":320},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d39487c61338/media/grapes.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/c4fdbaac52c02b751a408957c87deca340e780b01708c4e1b57932e12dd1177b.webp","width":320,"height":158},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d39487c61338/media/listing.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/a16c3226cd33bfbd604e3149b44e298a65ad819173c91edf2cedfa0581da6bf5.webp","width":320,"height":176},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d39487c61338/media/staff.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/91be978f77c7c6a0806d602ed45df645345eff54bdb1209ba14cb387845b2212.webp","width":320,"height":240},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-b75b1bf1f778/media/zip.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/e0f9806b274ab167c545661aa698a13db039b13f267e26dc66fffffceaad56cc.webp","width":320,"height":158},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-faa26839e9dd/media/washer.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/5625e98d5dd48ffa06de765cf567a2df85d170eddd7f3d2f2073ad0fe03ac484.webp","width":320,"height":219},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-d8dd1943c81d/media/tiles.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/aff140c7ba88a8fc6aefc0c9136b0038cfc770919b666e2fc4ebddbb21eeada3.webp","width":320,"height":206},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-6db7f588ae05/media/cookie.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/7aafb099a1a4c92e3d084508fa2769de17d937bec1a245df4e3343e8d2307267.webp","width":320,"height":159},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128155949-fcc99114-6db7f588ae05/media/note.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/b415f81c5767cd69411b90139cad13c5d87410b1821c9b0530d9a229b03b2d69.webp","width":320,"height":220},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261128